# Keep host-side state out of the image build context. Without this, the
# `COPY web/ ./` stage overlays the host's web/node_modules on top of the
# container's own `npm ci` (platform mismatch + races with a host npm run),
# and `.git`/worktrees bloat the context enormously.
.git
.claude
.venv
**/node_modules
web/dist
dist
src/frisket/web_static
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.secrets
data
